WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:06.756
Ultraman!

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:08.591
Stay back, it's still dangerous.

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:11.052
Please go seek refuge somewhere!

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:20.061
What?!

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:28.278
The bus will now depart.
Please use the grab handles.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:44.836
You bastard… Don't push your luck!

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:16.785
What's taking you so long, kid?

00:01:20.038 --> 00:01:21.206
Mr. Moroboshi.

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:26.669
He's still up?

00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:30.882
Why are you here?

00:01:31.674 --> 00:01:32.842
Do you know him?

00:01:32.967 --> 00:01:34.469
How could you not know?

00:01:34.552 --> 00:01:35.845
How could I?

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:37.680
This is Mochigon.

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:38.807
He's not a new alien.

00:01:39.474 --> 00:01:40.809
He's already registered.

00:01:41.726 --> 00:01:43.394
He's strong,

00:01:43.895 --> 00:01:45.980
but not enough to rampage around a city.

00:01:47.315 --> 00:01:49.984
He's still actually rampaging though.

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:56.157
Moroboshi, capture the alien alive.
I have some questions for him.

00:01:56.741 --> 00:01:57.867
As you say,

00:01:57.992 --> 00:02:00.495
something doesn't feel right to me.

00:02:12.882 --> 00:02:14.092
-Let's go.
-Got it.

